  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7007801",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700780101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700780101": {
            "id": "700780101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Matthew",
            "text": "You wouldn't know, Odolf. The Knights have already been there more times than I can count...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780102"
            ]
          },
          "700780102": {
            "id": "700780102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "Well, I've been in Snezhnaya lately. This is actually the first I've heard that the Knights have all been to the lighthouse... So what happened?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780103"
            ]
          },
          "700780103": {
            "id": "700780103",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Lennart",
            "text": "What do you think? The alarm in the old lighthouse still flickers from time to time. At first, Winslow would shout, \"The Abyss! It's the Abyss!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780104"
            ]
          },
          "700780104": {
            "id": "700780104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Matthew",
            "text": "The Knights took him seriously and went in fully armed, only to find there wasn't a single trace of the Abyss...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780105"
            ]
          },
          "700780105": {
            "id": "700780105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Matthew",
            "text": "After running back and forth like that a few times, they were completely worn out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780106"
            ]
          },
          "700780106": {
            "id": "700780106",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Lennart",
            "text": "If you ask me, it's just the old alarm mechanisms beneath the lighthouse wearing down. But... Well... there have been some rumors lately...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780107"
            ]
          },
          "700780107": {
            "id": "700780107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "Oh, goodness. And what kind of rumors could that be?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780108"
            ]
          },
          "700780108": {
            "id": "700780108",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Lennart",
            "text": "Rumors that the ghosts of knights, fallen in battle long ago, are the ones still seen wandering there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780109"
            ]
          },
          "700780109": {
            "id": "700780109",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "G—Ghosts!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780110"
            ]
          },
          "700780110": {
            "id": "700780110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Matthew",
            "text": "Whoa, you two. Don't yell when you're talking about scary things. You guys are even scarier than ghosts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780111"
            ]
          },
          "700780111": {
            "id": "700780111",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "S—Sorry, Paimon didn't mean to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780112"
            ]
          },
          "700780112": {
            "id": "700780112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "It's alright, it's alright. Conversations are always livelier with more people. And you are...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780113"
            ]
          },
          "700780113": {
            "id": "700780113",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You introduce yourselves to the group at the table...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780114"
            ]
          },
          "700780114": {
            "id": "700780114",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME} and Paimon... Oh, I see...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780115"
            ]
          },
          "700780115": {
            "id": "700780115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "By the way, how is Winslow doing these days?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780116"
            ]
          },
          "700780116": {
            "id": "700780116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Matthew",
            "text": "He was terrified by the light from the alarm. Living in the old lighthouse with mechanisms going off all the time would drive anyone crazy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780117"
            ]
          },
          "700780117": {
            "id": "700780117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Matthew",
            "text": "I've heard he's been acting a little crazy lately... Then again, you could say that's his well-deserved punishment. Why do you even care about him?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780118"
            ]
          },
          "700780118": {
            "id": "700780118",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "Well, we can't just leave the alarm mechanism as it is. As a matter of fact, I live near the old lighthouse. And besides...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780119"
            ]
          },
          "700780119": {
            "id": "700780119",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "There might be something else down there. I won't be able to rest easy until we go and check it out. We can't just leave poor old Winslow stuck there either, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780120"
            ]
          },
          "700780120": {
            "id": "700780120",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait... If that's the case, then the thing we ran into outside the old lighthouse earlier...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780122"
            ]
          },
          "700780122": {
            "id": "700780122",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780124"
            ]
          },
          "700780124": {
            "id": "700780124",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "Hm? You two ran into something near the old lighthouse? My oh my, could it be a ghost?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780125"
            ]
          },
          "700780125": {
            "id": "700780125",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "No. We met someone who looked frantic and completely out of it. Probably the person living in the old lighthouse, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780126"
            ]
          },
          "700780126": {
            "id": "700780126",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "...Winslow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780127"
            ]
          },
          "700780127": {
            "id": "700780127",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Lennart",
            "text": "You want to help Winslow?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780128"
            ]
          },
          "700780128": {
            "id": "700780128",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Lennart",
            "text": "Just so we're clear, the area below used to be an ancient battlefield. I'm not risking my life down there. Besides, even the Knights of Favonius have checked it out, and the problem still hasn't been solved...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780129"
            ]
          },
          "700780129": {
            "id": "700780129",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "That means we'll need someone even more reliable than the Knights. Say, a great hero who saved Mondstadt in the past, for example...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780130"
            ]
          },
          "700780130": {
            "id": "700780130",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmph hmph~ And where exactly could anyone find a hero like that?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
