            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Matthew",
            "text": "This is strange. Odolf is being unusually eager this time. Wasn't there some bad blood between him and Winslow?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780402"
            ]
          },
          "700780402": {
            "id": "700780402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Matthew",
            "text": "When I heard about Winslow, I expected at least a few sarcastic remarks from him..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
