    {
      "subId": "7007807",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Winslow",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700780701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700780701": {
            "id": "700780701",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Winslow",
            "text": "N—No... don't come closer... don't come closer... stop flashing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780702"
            ]
          },
          "700780702": {
            "id": "700780702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "Oh dear. Winslow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780703"
            ]
          },
          "700780703": {
            "id": "700780703",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Winslow",
            "text": "Wh—Who's there! I locked all the doors. How did you get in here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780704"
            ]
          },
          "700780704": {
            "id": "700780704",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Winslow",
            "text": "G—Ghosts. P—Please, I apologize. Don't come any closer!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780705"
            ]
          },
          "700780705": {
            "id": "700780705",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa... That looks really bad. He's barely making any sense.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780706"
            ]
          },
          "700780706": {
            "id": "700780706",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Winslow",
            "text": "The white ghost. The white ghost is here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780707"
            ]
          },
          "700780707": {
            "id": "700780707",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "With a loud scream, the man named Winslow nearly faints on the spot.\\nAfter Odolf's comforting words, he finally calms down and regains some of his senses.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780708"
            ]
          },
          "700780708": {
            "id": "700780708",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "Feeling better, Winslow?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780709"
            ]
          },
          "700780709": {
            "id": "700780709",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Winslow",
            "text": "Better? What do you mean better... Odolf, you... What are you doing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780710"
            ]
          },
          "700780710": {
            "id": "700780710",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Winslow",
            "text": "You came to laugh at me, didn't you? And you even brought that white thing with you, just to scare me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780711"
            ]
          },
          "700780711": {
            "id": "700780711",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Winslow",
            "text": "You locals. All of you. You've always pushed me away. You're jealous that I live here. You people, you people...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780712"
            ]
          },
          "700780712": {
            "id": "700780712",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "Calm down, Winslow. We're here to help you. We've always been helping you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780713"
            ]
          },
          "700780713": {
            "id": "700780713",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "When you were shouting about moving those \"damp, horrible, troublesome things\" from down below out to the fields beyond the port, we were the ones who stepped in and tried to stop you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780714"
            ]
          },
          "700780714": {
            "id": "700780714",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "Back then, I told you, \"There will be consequences, Winslow.\" ...It hurts me to see you like this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780715"
            ]
          },
          "700780715": {
            "id": "700780715",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Winslow",
            "text": "You...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780716"
            ]
          },
          "700780716": {
            "id": "700780716",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "#And then, just these past few days, I returned from Snezhnaya and heard that you were being tormented by some ghosts. So, I immediately brought {NICKNAME} and Paimon here. They can solve this problem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780717"
            ]
          },
          "700780717": {
            "id": "700780717",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "We've always been trying to help you, Winslow...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780718"
            ]
          },
          "700780718": {
            "id": "700780718",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Winslow",
            "text": "Who knows... Who knows if you're doing this on purpose...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780719"
            ]
          },
          "700780719": {
            "id": "700780719",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "#*sigh* Even if you don't trust me, you should at least trust {NICKNAME}. {M#He}{F#She} is an Honorary Knight of the Knights of Favonius.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780720"
            ]
          },
          "700780720": {
            "id": "700780720",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Winslow",
            "text": "I...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780721"
            ]
          },
          "700780721": {
            "id": "700780721",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "That's enough, Winslow. Staying here isn't doing any favors for your sanity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780722"
            ]
          },
          "700780722": {
            "id": "700780722",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "#Look at this poor fellow! {NICKNAME}, Paimon, I'll take him up above to get some fresh air. We'll leave the ruins to you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780723"
            ]
          },
          "700780723": {
            "id": "700780723",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "If we fail...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780724"
            ]
          },
          "700780724": {
            "id": "700780724",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Then we'll become one of them too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780725"
            ]
          },
          "700780725": {
            "id": "700780725",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Winslow",
            "text": "Eeeeeee!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780726"
            ]
          },
          "700780726": {
            "id": "700780726",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Seriously, there you go, saying creepy things again. Stop scaring people like that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780727"
            ]
          },
          "700780727": {
            "id": "700780727",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Odolf",
            "text": "Haha. I doubt whatever's down there is that dangerous. Well then, best of luck getting everything sorted out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780728"
            ]
          },
          "700780728": {
            "id": "700780728",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, we definitely will!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700780729"
            ]
          },
          "700780729": {
            "id": "700780729",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Odolf leads the unsteady, pale Winslow away from the ruins beneath the lighthouse..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
